**Conclusion**  
As we move into Q3 2023, Green Light Utilities is committed to enhancing operational efficiency and customer engagement. Continued investment in technology and strategic partnerships will be essential in meeting the rising demands of our service areas, particularly in **Colorado Springs** and **Fort Collins**.

